{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/day_strain.dart:offset-10087", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/day_strain.dart", "location": "offset-10087", "text": "'The day strain is ${s.toStringAsFixed(1)}. The waking minutes '\n'it was built from are not stored for this day.'", "sha256": "4e8fa91a3683e05912468ed2ad7dbafa4c73806bdeb2fbf6d5f75fe12168053b", "kind": "dart", "start": 10087, "end": 10222, "line": 261}
