{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/day_strain.dart:offset-10941", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/day_strain.dart", "location": "offset-10941", "text": "'Effort banked above your usual waking pace — it can ease '\n'later in the day if intensity drops back toward that '\n'pace, even though the STEEP parts already happened. '\n'Built from $drawn recorded waking minutes.'", "sha256": "cfb768b4eee4b9075f9c5f8da1a7643a64dc455413a44ba8a3d339c7e5336f67", "kind": "dart", "start": 10941, "end": 11216, "line": 283}
