{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/day_strain.dart:offset-14815", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/day_strain.dart", "location": "offset-14815", "text": "'It was integrated against an assumed maximum of '\n'${max.round()} bpm — estimated from your age and your strap, '\n'not measured.'", "sha256": "e76e2b8c6c45c7ceac8db3646a468f3d6f19130750c034750ef4c1d65eca7231", "kind": "dart", "start": 14815, "end": 14985, "line": 376}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/day_strain.dart:offset-15415", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/day_strain.dart", "location": "offset-15415", "text": "'The zone bar above uses the measured ceiling instead; strain has '\n'not been moved onto it, because that would rewrite every '\n'strain score you have ever seen.'", "sha256": "871a4ed6af97230f2ab569384e48e7bed31b5bb379ffd0d5183bcb5431d68ff2", "kind": "dart", "start": 15415, "end": 15617, "line": 385}
{"id": "lib/ui2/activity/day_strain.dart:offset-15674", "file": "lib/ui2/activity/day_strain.dart", "location": "offset-15674", "text": "'The other anchor is your resting heart rate from the night before, '\n'so a night the band missed moves the whole day.'", "sha256": "97d956a2056ae9cffd3d4c9d270426c27ef9cc6dbbdce01bb9676c65b8d5bf75", "kind": "dart", "start": 15674, "end": 15811, "line": 389}
